meta {
  name: Risk VaR
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/risk/var
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Parametric, historical and Monte-Carlo VaR plus expected shortfall for the live book, reported
  side by side because their disagreement is the information.

  `sumOfAbsolutesVarUsd` is what the pre-4.6.1 aggregation would have reported, and
  `diversificationRatio` is the quotient — so the value of the covariance upgrade stays
  continuously auditable instead of being a claim in a PR description.
}
